### Expense Report - All
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/expense/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/expense/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Department Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/expense/?department=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Employee Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/expense/?employee=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expense Category Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/expense/?expense_category=TRAVEL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approval Status - Approved
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/expense/?approval_status=Approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approval Status - Pending Verification
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/expense/?approval_status=In%20Verification
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Graph Year Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/expense/?chart_year=2025&graph_year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/expense/?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Combined Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/expense/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-31&department=1&employee=1&expense_category=TRAVEL&approval_status=Approve&chart_year=2026&graph_year=2026&page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
